---
import PolicySection from "./PolicySection.astro";
import { ul } from "./styles";
---

<PolicySection title="How long we keep it">
  <ul class:list={ul}>
    <li>
      Your account, your nickname, your membership, your participation and the days or weeks you mark done, session data
      and the security log: until your account is deleted.
    </li>
    <li>
      Your group and the tasks you create: until they are deleted. When you delete your account, they stay for the
      group's other members, if it has any (see "Deleting your account").
    </li>
    <li>Request logs, ours and Cloudflare's: up to 7 days.</li>
    <li>Error reports: up to 90 days (30 days on Sentry's free plan, 90 days while an organization trial runs).</li>
    <li>E-mail delivery logs: 30 days.</li>
    <li>Supabase platform logs: 1 day.</li>
    <li>Cookies: see the next section.</li>
  </ul>
</PolicySection>
